# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1339
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_c0e602ec:

    # na "This fucking SUCKED because I was already well established in my old school."
    na "这他妈糟透了，因为我在原来的学校已经站稳脚跟了。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1340
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_9788fc07:

    # na "I had a few real good friends."
    na "我有几个真正的好朋友。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1341
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_a5962b42:

    # na "And this new place was full of people that were very…{w} clicky."
    na "而新地方到处是很……{w}抱团排外的人。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1343
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_77b828f8:

    # gi "How so?"
    gi "怎么说？"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1345
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_98c6fe4d:

    # na "If you didn’t fit their little box, they’d outcast you socially."
    na "只要你不合他们的框框，就会被他们在社交上排挤。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1346
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_8f92229b:

    # na "Issues of going to a small school, I guess."
    na "我想这是小学校的问题。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1349
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_d73ba3e6:

    # na "But anyway, that’s when I would connect with my friends from the old town I used to live in."
    na "不过，也正是那时，我跟以前住的镇子上的朋友们联系上了。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1350
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_8f56ced0:

    # na "My parents were pretty well-off, so they helped me get a pretty expensive… device to allow me to play these games."
    na "我父母条件不错，所以帮我买了一台挺贵的……设备，可以玩这些游戏。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1351
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_dda8ddf2:

    # na "I’d play them and talk to my friends, our sessions would kind of last for hours."
    na "我就玩着游戏跟朋友聊天，一局能玩上好几个小时。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1352
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_bac67d22:

    # na "Helped me feel way less lonely."
    na "这让我不再那么孤单。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1354
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_7d72a28c:

    # na "Some time went on where we’d keep on hanging out this way, and one of my friends told me I should definitely try streaming."
    na "这样过了一段时间，有一天一个朋友告诉我我一定该试试做主播。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1355
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_a17d59e9:

    # na "She said that she does it every so often and does pretty well."
    na "她说自己偶尔也做，而且做得不错。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1356
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_cca023c4:

    # na "So we decided to stream together, she already had around 1000 people joining in to watch her."
    na "于是我们决定一起播，她已经有一千人左右在看她直播了。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1359
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_8cbd3e3c:

    # na "And that’s when we became huge."
    na "那之后我们就火了。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1360
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_aa10d008:

    # na "We’ve been streaming for about 7 years now."
    na "我们做主播已经大约七年了。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1361
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_72e35522:

    # na "She now doesn’t have much time to stream as she’s still studying and apparently has a really demanding job, but when we do our numbers go waaaay up!"
    na "她现在要念书，还有一份据说很忙的工作，所以没多少时间播，但只要我们一起播，数字就会暴涨！"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1364
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_55c50b91:

    # na "So yeah, most of my days are taken over by playing games and talking to people."
    na "是啊，我大部分日子都在打游戏和跟人聊天中度过。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1367
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_6645cee4:

    # yu "Wow…"
    yu "哇……"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1368
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_d80183c6:

    # yu "So cool…"
    yu "太酷了……"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1371
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_908b21c1:

    # rav "I think so too!"
    rav "我也觉得！"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1372
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_23a3d93c:

    # rav "Plus, I’m sure you definitely have a lot of freedom to do whatever you want, right?"
    rav "而且我敢肯定你有很大自由，想做什么就做什么，对吧？"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1375
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_1c500170:

    # na "To an extent, yes."
    na "某种程度上，是的。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1376
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_c0b44af6:

    # na "I do have to follow certain trends and such as this is still a job."
    na "不过我还是得follow一些潮流，毕竟这还是份工作。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1377
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_58b4d735:

    # na "But for the most part I set my own schedule and do as I please."
    na "但大部分时间我自己安排，想怎样就怎样。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1378
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_463be86c:

    # na "Which is pretty damn great."
    na "这他妈简直太爽了。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1381
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_edf2ff97:

    # rav "I’m so jealous!"
    rav "我好羡慕！"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1384
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_ade05ced:

    # gi "Me too, sounds like a very enjoyable lifestyle."
    gi "我也是，听起来是很享受的生活方式。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1387
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_2b29dc6e:

    # na "Oh for sure, can’t complain at all hehe."
    na "当然，完全没得抱怨，嘿嘿。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1388
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_6c314873:

    # na "Anyway…"
    na "总之……"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:1392
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_300218cb:

    # "Whose story would you like to hear next?"
    "接下来你想听谁的故事？"

