    # bm "To this day, we are truly unsure of what happened."
    bm "至今我们仍不清楚当时发生了什么。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:595
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_e816bb3d_1:

    # bm "Some say divine intervention."
    bm "有人说是神的干预。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:596
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_c822dcb0_1:

    # bm "Others that the Dark Caster simply stopped fighting."
    bm "也有人说那位暗系施法者只是忽然不打了。"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:597
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_fbf125cd_1:

    # bm "What we do know is that many people suffered…"
    bm "我们确知的是，无数人因此受难……"

# game/chapters/chapter_two/chapter_two.rpy:598
translate schinese chapter_two_scene_six_9fd839fe_1:

    # bm "And so, since then we have looked for ways to keep the peace."
    bm "所以从那以后，我们就一直在寻找维持和平的方法。"

